    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1264">

                <pb facs="0875" n="759" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg759"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/7910.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Schmutz to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Aguascalientes</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-06-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 12, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report that I left to
                    [go to] the city of Zacatecas on the 10th instant to inquire into the conditions
                    of the American and other foreign residents in that city.* * *</p>
                <p>Pánfilo Natera levied a forced loan on the commercial and financial houses
                    amounting to a total of $110,000.00 Mexican Cy. and the following are a few of
                    the largest contributors: <table cols="2" rows="7">
                        <row role="label">
                            <cell>The National Bank of Mexico</cell>
                            <cell role="num">$9,000.00</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Bank of Zacatecas</cell>
                            <cell role="num">5,000.00</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>El Bote Mining Company (English)</cell>
                            <cell role="num">5,000.00</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Magistral Mine Company (American)</cell>
                            <cell role="num">4,000.00</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Parroquia</cell>
                            <cell role="num">2,000.00</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Fresnillo Mining Company (American)</cell>
                            <cell role="num">800.00</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Gualterio C. Palmer (English)</cell>
                            <cell role="num">500.00</cell>
                        </row>
                    </table>
                </p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gaston Schmutz</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
